"Yeah, mate."

00:01:18.534 --> 00:01:20.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.901
-How cool is that?
-What?!

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:24.567
-Did you get nervous?
Did you know that he was coming

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:26.367
