-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:28.334
They sort of lay out
the red carpet and all that.

00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:30.200
-Of course.
-Yeah, but he was only
a prince then,

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.667
so he was like small,
he was small-fry.

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:32.968
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, yeah, at that point.

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:34.968
Now, he's king, yeah, he's like,
"Do you remember me?"

00:01:34.968 --> 00:01:36.834
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
-Yeah, of course.

00:01:36.834 --> 00:01:38.234
-Can we talk
about "House of the Dragon"?

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:39.434
-Yeah, yeah.
-Congrats.

00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:40.968
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Thank you, brother.

00:01:40.968 --> 00:01:42.734
-Giant hit.
You're awesome in it.

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:44.067
You're really good in it.

00:01:44.067 --> 00:01:46.300
-Thank you very much.
-I have questions about where

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:47.434
-It's very cult.
-your character goes.

00:01:47.434 --> 00:01:48.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.767 --> 00:01:50.634
I'm not completely caught up
as everyone else.

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:51.834
Don't worry about it, yeah.
-Yeah? Okay, good.

00:01:51.834 --> 00:01:52.501
