00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:53.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:54.901
-Well, eventually,
you have to get caught up.

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:56.067
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
-Yeah, but not right now,

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:57.200
